## What's Coming Later (After March)

These features will come in spring/summer 2025:

- Automatic reminder emails (2 days before + morning of)
- Waitlists when events fill up
- "Sold Out" indicators
- Calendar view option
- Hike leader self-service for registration lists
- Collecting names of additional guests (not just "party of 3")

